\0
In the early stages of the conflict, the Freedom Guard was limited to minor acts of sabotage against the Imperium. A young Freedom Guard officer, Jeb Radec, plotted a bold frontal raid on a sizable Imperium supply depot of pure water on the planet Alcine. The plan was considered a suicide mission by the fledgling Freedom Guard ruling Synod, but Radec ignored the Synod and led the assault with a small team of volunteers.
\1
A potable water depot on Alcine has been seized by a group of insurgents. Attack the depot and destroy those who have challenged us. Demolish all water processing facilities.
\n\n
