\2
Excellent. You have made the first step in a long journey.\n
\n
\cHISTORICAL OUTCOME:\n
The Imperium water processing facility on Alcine was seized by a small Freedom Guard force. The invaders were only able to hold the facility for a short time while Imperium reserves made their way to the position and routed the invaders. Freedom Guard forces did manage to transport a sizable shipment of water off of the planet in the interim. The officer who led the raid, Jeb Radec, was shortly thereafter elected to the Synod and became one of the Freedom Guard's leading commanders.

\3
Failure cannot be afforded. Try again.
